1
00:00:11,512 --> 00:00:19,476
The Hands of Orlac .

2
00:01:29,047 --> 00:01:35,293
Beloved , in one day and one night I will again be with you .

3
00:01:35,345 --> 00:01:41,591
I will hold you in my arms ... My hands will run over your hair ...

4
00:01:41,727 --> 00:01:47,347
And I will feel your body tremble under my hands .

5
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:50,940
Orlac 's Concert .

6
00:02:21,808 --> 00:02:29,806
Madam , it is 9 o 'clock and the train arrives at 11 .

7
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:20,833
To Montgeron !

8
00:08:43,314 --> 00:08:47,148
He is alive !

9
00:11:05,832 --> 00:11:12,704
It is 6 : 30 , Professor . Vasseur will be executed at 6 o 'clock ,

10
00:11:12,839 --> 00:11:20,086
and 8 minutes later the car will bring the body to the clinic .

11
00:11:52,378 --> 00:11:59,341
A train accident ... Mr. Orlac is severely injured .

12
00:12:55,275 --> 00:12:57,266
And yet there is hope .

13
00:12:57,318 --> 00:13:03,314
There is damage at the base of the skull , where we will operate ... Only ... "

14
00:13:14,711 --> 00:13:18,044
Only his hands .

15
00:13:26,597 --> 00:13:31,091
The hands ... Oh holy god ... The hands !

16
00:13:49,746 --> 00:13:55,491
Save his hands ... His hands are his life ...

17
00:14:16,647 --> 00:14:24,611
Save his hands ! His hands are more important than his life .

18
00:14:59,690 --> 00:15:03,399
Save his hands .

19
00:16:25,359 --> 00:16:30,023
After only a short time , you can come home ...

20
00:16:30,239 --> 00:16:36,405
And sun , light and many flowers will greet you , when you come .

21
00:16:57,058 --> 00:17:01,677
We will remove your bandages a little at a time .

22
00:17:01,771 --> 00:17:05,138
Today you will see your face again .

23
00:19:10,650 --> 00:19:15,644
Your eyes ... How I love you ... Your hair ...

24
00:19:32,421 --> 00:19:38,417
And your hands ... Your beautiful , dear hands ...

25
00:20:00,449 --> 00:20:06,570
There ... His head ... Doesn 't he see my hands ?

26
00:20:11,585 --> 00:20:15,077
Is he laughing ?

27
00:20:17,091 --> 00:20:21,676
Now ... He is so strong !

28
00:21:21,405 --> 00:21:29,403
Tell me , what is under these bandages ? What secret do they hide ?

29
00:21:34,668 --> 00:21:40,413
Well , then , in god 's name , we will reveal the secret .

30
00:22:45,948 --> 00:22:51,739
Can these hands ever play again ?

31
00:22:57,084 --> 00:23:00,326
The spirit rules the hands ...

32
00:23:00,379 --> 00:23:05,248
Nature and a strong will can do anything .

33
00:23:43,172 --> 00:23:47,666
Tomorrow ... Back tomorrow !

34
00:23:50,679 --> 00:23:58,677
Here I will wait ... His first kiss and the first stroke of his hands .

35
00:24:06,320 --> 00:24:09,687
The last night .

36
00:25:41,165 --> 00:25:47,536
Your hands were not saved - Dr. Serral gave you different ones -

37
00:25:47,671 --> 00:25:53,007
the hands of the executed murderer Vasseur .

38
00:27:39,241 --> 00:27:46,238
Is it true ? Do I have the hands of the murderer Vasseur ?

39
00:28:26,205 --> 00:28:30,039
How much longer ?

40
00:30:08,682 --> 00:30:15,554
These hands will never strike a man again !

41
00:30:22,154 --> 00:30:28,901
In half an hour ... No , only 30 minutes ...

42
00:35:26,499 --> 00:35:32,290
I love you ... I love you ...

43
00:36:24,057 --> 00:36:31,099
Do you have the paper from January 15th ?

44
00:37:23,783 --> 00:37:31,121
The murderer Vasseur before his judges ...

45
00:37:37,672 --> 00:37:40,914
Vasseur denied the act ...

46
00:37:41,050 --> 00:37:45,919
But the fingerprints that were found gave the real evidence .

47
00:37:52,270 --> 00:37:57,435
The dagger , which was stuck into the heart of the old racketeer ,

48
00:37:57,442 --> 00:38:00,309
bore the same x mark on the handle .

49
00:38:01,821 --> 00:38:07,657
Also , the dagger bore Vasseur 's unmistakable fingerprints .

50
00:38:07,702 --> 00:38:13,572
The evidence was so clear that he received the death penalty .

51
00:41:13,096 --> 00:41:16,839
I feel it also go out ... The arms spread ...

52
00:41:16,891 --> 00:41:21,134
Until then , in the soul ... Cold , terrible , grim .

53
00:41:39,497 --> 00:41:43,911
Twisted , twisted hands !

54
00:42:12,405 --> 00:42:17,570
I don 't want to save you ? I will not come ... Not my ... No more ...

55
00:42:17,660 --> 00:42:22,700
I cannot any more ... You are coming to kill ...

56
00:42:22,832 --> 00:42:29,954
But I will not follow your terrible orders any more ... No more !

57
00:45:44,533 --> 00:45:49,118
Don 't come any closer to me !

58
00:47:41,108 --> 00:47:47,024
Go away ... I will not listen to you any longer !

59
00:48:09,178 --> 00:48:13,262
Debauch your hands !

60
00:52:10,127 --> 00:52:17,169
Don 't mix ... Away with your hands ... Those murderer 's hands !

61
00:52:57,966 --> 00:53:04,963
Take away your hands . I don 't want these terrible hands .

62
00:53:08,852 --> 00:53:12,845
Creditors .

63
00:53:23,992 --> 00:53:30,739
Only wait a short time ... One month ...

64
00:53:42,636 --> 00:53:49,883
I know it ... You demand blood ... Crimes ... Murder ...

65
00:54:04,616 --> 00:54:08,234
Only one week !

66
00:54:17,629 --> 00:54:20,666
Men don 't just control the hands ...

67
00:54:20,758 --> 00:54:25,627
The head , the heart control the body ... Also the hands .

68
00:54:46,700 --> 00:54:50,284
Until tomorrow !

69
00:55:46,009 --> 00:55:49,251
My hat and my coat ...

70
00:55:49,346 --> 00:55:55,967
l am going to my husband 's father . He is rich ...

71
00:55:56,103 --> 00:55:58,890
He can help ... If he will ...

72
00:56:05,904 --> 00:56:09,396
Don 't go there ... He is an evil man ...

73
00:56:09,408 --> 00:56:13,902
He hates all men and even more so your husband ...

74
00:57:21,063 --> 00:57:29,061
I can 't leave anyone to him ... At the least everyone from ... There .

75
00:59:08,295 --> 00:59:12,413
Mr. Orlac , Paul can no longer play .

76
00:59:12,466 --> 00:59:17,586
So we are in need . But Paul doesn 't know ... Help us !

77
00:59:37,991 --> 00:59:45,079
He is your son ... Your flesh and blood ... Will you let us be ground in to the earth ?

78
00:59:48,585 --> 00:59:54,330
Yes , I would like that ! I hate him !

79
01:02:17,609 --> 01:02:24,651
Mr. 0rlac must himself go to see his father ... Today !

80
01:02:30,038 --> 01:02:34,657
How will madam pay ?

81
01:03:10,578 --> 01:03:18,576
Beloved , in one day and one night I will again be with you .

82
01:03:18,712 --> 01:03:25,959
I will hold you in my arms ... My hands will run over your hair ...

83
01:03:35,603 --> 01:03:41,473
That was ... Once ... My handwriting .

84
01:04:05,216 --> 01:04:08,879
After one day and one night .

85
01:05:12,033 --> 01:05:20,031
Go to your father ... Today ... He must help us ... We can 't go on ...

86
01:05:51,739 --> 01:05:57,609
He refused to help ... And I have begged him so .

87
01:05:57,620 --> 01:06:04,617
He is not a good man , your father ... He is evil . I fear him .

88
01:07:51,734 --> 01:07:55,443
Murder !

89
01:08:42,702 --> 01:08:47,241
The murderer Vasseur 's dagger !

90
01:09:18,279 --> 01:09:22,864
The fingerprints of the criminal Vasseur !

91
01:10:17,463 --> 01:10:22,082
Your sister is very ill ... Come right away ,

92
01:10:22,218 --> 01:10:29,215
if you want to see her while she is still alive ... Come today !

93
01:10:41,946 --> 01:10:47,691
Vasseur 's handwriting !

94
01:11:01,632 --> 01:11:06,251
I do not know what secret he is going to give us ...

95
01:11:06,387 --> 01:11:11,097
Vasseur has been dead for years , but his hands still live !

96
01:14:40,685 --> 01:14:44,098
Paul Orlac , you are your father 's heir .

97
01:14:44,188 --> 01:14:48,727
You will bring me a million tomorrow . At this time !

98
01:14:59,203 --> 01:15:06,120
Money ? Money ? And that 's why you follow me awake and in my dreams ?

99
01:15:18,889 --> 01:15:22,381
Why ?

100
01:15:26,647 --> 01:15:30,105
For my hands !

101
01:16:10,566 --> 01:16:14,150
Who are you ?

102
01:16:30,211 --> 01:16:37,458
I am Vasseur , who was executed on July 13th .

103
01:16:49,688 --> 01:16:56,230
The experiment that Professor Serral performed with your hands ...

104
01:16:56,362 --> 01:17:00,230
His assistant made off with my head .

105
01:17:22,638 --> 01:17:28,383
If I don 't get the million tomorrow at this time

106
01:17:28,519 --> 01:17:35,391
I will go to the state prosecutor and tell him who your father 's murderer is .

107
01:17:40,781 --> 01:17:44,399
Who is the murderer ?

108
01:17:49,290 --> 01:17:52,782
You are ... Paul Orlac !

109
01:18:01,927 --> 01:18:09,925
These fingerprints , which are clearly visible are the fingerprints of Vasseur .

110
01:18:10,561 --> 01:18:15,931
And who has those fingers now ? You , Paul Orlac !

111
01:18:25,451 --> 01:18:30,536
The letter , which passed through all the servants in the house ,

112
01:18:30,539 --> 01:18:33,451
was written by the hand of Vasseur ,

113
01:18:35,461 --> 01:18:39,670
and this hand is now your hand !

114
01:18:41,050 --> 01:18:48,968
The dagger , with which the murder was committed , is Vasseur 's dagger with the x ' .

115
01:18:49,600 --> 01:18:55,095
Your maid will swear that she saw you with it ... In your hand !

116
01:19:28,639 --> 01:19:36,136
Perhaps you did not commit the murder , but you cannot prove it .

117
01:21:06,737 --> 01:21:12,607
What is happening to me ? Am I crazy ?

118
01:21:25,381 --> 01:21:30,091
Won 't you tell me what is bothering you ?

119
01:22:00,416 --> 01:22:08,380
I have the feeling , that these hands are drawing me ... To crime ...

120
01:23:05,481 --> 01:23:10,191
I must bring him the money .

121
01:23:27,961 --> 01:23:33,501
You will tell the state prosecutor everything ...

122
01:23:39,973 --> 01:23:44,637
Who will believe me ?

123
01:24:00,035 --> 01:24:05,655
They will believe you as I believe you .

124
01:25:00,053 --> 01:25:05,798
I go in a free man .

125
01:25:21,992 --> 01:25:27,862
Wait , perhaps you have some news for the evening paper .

126
01:25:35,380 --> 01:25:43,344
It is odd , but I don 't know whether I am experiencing reality or a dream .

127
01:27:22,738 --> 01:27:26,230
A stranger ...

128
01:27:42,758 --> 01:27:44,840
He was then executed ...

129
01:27:44,885 --> 01:27:50,846
I have seen with my own eyes the work of the guillotine on a neck .

130
01:28:45,445 --> 01:28:51,315
Mr. Orlac , we thank you for your evidence ...

131
01:28:57,916 --> 01:29:05,834
Go this evening , bring the money with you to the stranger ,

132
01:29:05,924 --> 01:29:09,587
and we will follow you .

133
01:30:39,643 --> 01:30:46,139
Someone well known to us ... Mr. Nera , at last . Assistant to Dr. Serral , â  

134
01:30:46,316 --> 01:30:51,436
one of the least talented crooks in the world .

135
01:31:50,380 --> 01:31:57,502
I am also a blackmailer ! But ... You are searching for the murderer ?

136
01:32:03,268 --> 01:32:08,888
Haven 't you considered that the murderer has Vasseur 's hands ...

137
01:32:08,898 --> 01:32:11,355
I don 't have those hands .

138
01:32:20,744 --> 01:32:25,534
I can tell you who has those hands .

139
01:33:04,704 --> 01:33:12,702
Mr. Orlac , I arrest you !

140
01:33:21,221 --> 01:33:28,309
Mr. Orlac is innocent . Nera is the murderer !

141
01:33:51,751 --> 01:33:55,243
Be quiet !

142
01:34:04,639 --> 01:34:11,636
Tell me ! What about the fingerprints of the executed Vasseur ?

143
01:34:18,653 --> 01:34:26,651
Nera was Vasseur 's friend ... He secretly made imprints of Vasseur 's fingerprints .

144
01:34:28,663 --> 01:34:36,411
And then he had rubber gloves made ... With Vasseur 's fingerprints .

145
01:35:02,280 --> 01:35:06,899
And so he killed the elder Orlac ...

146
01:35:25,595 --> 01:35:28,462
And so he killed the old racketeer ,

147
01:35:28,556 --> 01:35:32,549
and then made it look as if Vasseur had done it ...

148
01:35:32,602 --> 01:35:35,810
Vasseur died an innocent man .

149
01:35:53,748 --> 01:36:00,711
If Vasseur was not guilty , then my hands are pure ...

